The Go rendering: an application whose const blocks hold shapes a deletion
cannot renumber by one step (a shift and a division of iota, a restated list, a
product of a member), shapes it would break (a division or a shift a lower iota
makes invalid, a value below an int8's least, two names in one specification, a
first specification the next one repeats), a boolean and a complex group, and
controls a deletion moves cleanly.

